
TIMER_02_LED_TOGGLE.c

Developed LED blinking functionality using STM32 timers. LEDs toggle automatically at fixed intervals without relying on software delay loops.

TIMER_INTERRUPT.c

Implemented timer interrupt handling using STM32 NVIC and timer peripherals. Executed specific tasks periodically whenever the timer interrupt event occurred.

TIMER_LED_BRIGHTNESS.c

Controlled LED brightness using PWM (Pulse Width Modulation) generated by STM32 timers. Adjusted duty cycle values to vary LED intensity smoothly.
